[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749756101","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104582#issuecomment-2749756101","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104582","id":2749756101,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j5fLF","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T00:53:06Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T00:55:41Z","body":"> The docs generators seem to call this function to get a default value, upon which the code incorrectly complains. I think this is somewhat questionable behavior, but it's not really something we can fix right now. So this is the best solution I came up with.\r\n\r\n`GLOBAL_DEF_NOVAL()` can be used to ignore the default value in the generated documentation. Maybe it should be used in the location where the CameraServer error occurs when calling `--doctool`, but I haven't found any uses of `GLOBAL_*` in `modules/camera/*` nor `servers/camera_server.*` (or `ProjectSettings::get`, just in case).\r\n\r\n**Edit:** I found the correct way to override it for `--doctool`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6b5b84c0c50135e88691e035d3e00c68a2ae5aa4/core/core_bind.cpp#L741-L744\r\n\r\nUse `ADD_PROPERTY_DEFAULT()` just after `ADD_PROPERTY()` to force the default value that will appear in the generated documentation. `--doctool` won't call the code that returns the default value anymore when doing this. Adding it to CameraTexture's properties that need it should do the trick.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749756101/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749783031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104582#issuecomment-2749783031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104582","id":2749783031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j5lv3","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T01:11:59Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T01:27:49Z","body":"Awesome, thanks for doing the research! I've uploaded a new version of the fix, using `ADD_PROPERTY_DEFAULT` as you suggested. This fixes the problem on my end too (i think, hard to be sure 😅).\r\n\r\nI'm not 100% sure this doesn't cause any side effects, but if it doesn't, this is a better fix for the problem.\r\nEdit: As far as I can see, `ADD_PROPERTY_DEFAULT` has been used with reference to 'docs' several times in the codebase, and I found one or two mentions of it being used for that online too. So I'd guess that's what it's intended for. Shame it doesn't appear to be documented!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749783031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2750546700","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104582#issuecomment-2750546700","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104582","id":2750546700,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j8gMM","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T08:57:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T08:57:18Z","body":"> Edit: As far as I can see, `ADD_PROPERTY_DEFAULT` has been used with reference to 'docs' several times in the codebase, and I found one or two mentions of it being used for that online too. So I'd guess that's what it's intended for. Shame it doesn't appear to be documented!\r\n\r\nIt is only meant for use in docs indeed, to fake a common default value in cases where the actual default may be system specific or something that we don't want in the docs.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2750546700/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751806208","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104582#issuecomment-2751806208","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104582","id":2751806208,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kBTsA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T16:15:22Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T16:15:22Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751806208/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]